请状态更新','关于您的申请有重要更新，请查看详情。你的申请材料已经提交，正在审核中','application_update','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-22 19:42:42','2025-10-22 19:42:42',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(22,3,'畅畅','teacher',20,105,'牛津大学面试','My name is NUOTIAN FAN, I am writing to urgently request a free rescheduling of my TOEFL exam due to issues I encountered during my recent test session on  Sunday, October 12, 2025, 02:30 PM. Unfortunately, I was unable to access the exam ,When I entered the exam waiting interface, it showed that I had to wait for the examiner, When I entered the exam security check, the examiner closed my exam without any reason. I didn\'t even enter the exam interface. I was just in the security check process. So I refreshed the interface, but it showed that I could no longer enter the exam. Then I sought help from customer service, but it kept showing as fourth place. After 20 minutes, I still couldn\'t contact customer service.\n\nAs a result, I am now facing significant time pressure, as my school application deadline is fast approaching, and I am in urgent need of my TOEFL score to complete my applications.\n\nGiven that these issues were beyond my control, I kindly request a free rescheduling of my ex','application_update','important',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-22 23:45:59','2025-10-26 23:05:24',_binary '\0','2025-10-22 23:46:16.000000',NULL),(23,3,'畅畅','teacher',20,107,'提交的护照扫描有问题','你提交的护照文件正反扫描不清楚，需要重新上传文件，请你在文件上传栏删除文件后重新上传，时间在2025年10月22日23:00前','material_reminder','urgent',1,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-22 23:57:10','2025-10-26 23:05:24',_binary '\0','2025-10-22 23:57:33.000000',NULL),(24,3,'畅畅','teacher',20,108,'关于您的帝国理工学院申请状态更新','Urgent Request for Retake Due to Repeated Technical Issues During TOEFL Exam [Incident: 251020-005201]\n收件箱\n\nTS Returns\n10月21日周二 22:58 (2天前)\n发送至 我\n\nAbhinay K. @ 10/21/2025 10:58 AM:\nHello Nuotian Fan,\n\nThank you for your email. Your test is under administrative review. Please allow 3-5 business days for the review to be completed. We are unable to expedite the process at this time. After that time frame, if your concern is still unresolved, you may call (609) 406-5430 for an update.\n\nRegards,\nOffice of Testing Integrity\n\nxw c @ 10/20/2025 11:16 PM:\nMy name is NUOTIAN FAN, I am writing to urgently request a free rescheduling of my TOEFL exam due to issues I encountered during my recent test session on  Sunday, October 12, 2025, 02:30 PM. Unfortunately, I was unable to access the exam ,When I entered the exam waiting interface, it showed that I had to wait for the examiner, When I entered the exam security check, the examiner closed my exam without any reason. I didn\'t even enter the exam','application_update','important',1,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-23 11:27:00','2025-10-26 23:05:24',_binary '\0','2025-10-23 11:27:26.000000',NULL),(25,3,'畅畅','teacher',20,108,'关于您的帝国理工学院申请状态更新','stevenchen，你好：\n\n好消息。你现在可以通过 https://apple.com/recover 为 Apple 账户 (cxw20010928@gmail.com) 重设密码。\n\n为避免延误您使用帐户，请在未来 7 天内执行此操作（截止日期为2025年10月28日）。','application_update','normal',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-23 11:27:22','2025-10-26 23:05:24',_binary '\0','2025-10-23 11:27:25.000000',NULL),(26,4,'YY','teacher',42,110,'材料提交','你的护照扫描有问题，已经打回，需要你重新上传，截止日期为2025年10月15日，需要你快速上传','material_reminder','urgent',1,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-23 16:21:39','2025-10-23 16:22:40',_binary '\0','2025-10-23 16:22:40.000000',NULL),(27,4,'YY','teacher',42,110,'材料截止','关于您的申请有重要更新，请查看详情。材料提交即将截止，请加快提交速度，方便我们老师进行审核','deadline_notice','important',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-23 16:22:36','2025-10-23 16:22:47',_binary '\0','2025-10-23 16:22:47.000000',NULL),(28,4,'YY','teacher',42,110,'入学通知','关于您的申请有重要更新，请查看详情。\n你将于2025年xxx前往牛津大学入学，请注意查收邮件','general_message','important',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-23 16:23:40','2025-10-26 17:17:07',_binary '\0','2025-10-26 17:17:07.000000',NULL),(29,4,'YY','teacher',42,110,'关于您的牛津大学申请状态更新','133123123','material_reminder','normal',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-26 17:16:47','2025-10-26 17:19:26',_binary '\0','2025-10-26 17:19:26.000000',NULL),(42,4,'YY','teacher',42,110,'消息通知','2222222222222222222','application_update','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 00:14:51','2025-10-27 00:14:51',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(43,4,'YY','teacher',42,110,'消息通知','我是','general_message','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 00:15:53','2025-10-27 00:15:53',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(44,4,'YY','teacher',42,110,'消息通知','我是yy','general_message','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 00:16:04','2025-10-27 00:16:04',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(45,4,'YY','teacher',41,109,'消息通知','2131231','general_message','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 00:17:02','2025-10-27 00:17:02',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(46,4,'YY','teacher',41,109,'消息通知','22222','general_message','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 00:18:48','2025-10-27 00:18:48',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(47,4,'YY','teacher',41,109,'消息通知','33333333','general_message','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 00:18:53','2025-10-27 00:18:53',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(48,4,'YY','teacher',41,109,'消息通知','你是谁','general_message','normal',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 12:36:09','2025-10-27 12:36:09',_binary '\0',NULL,NULL),(49,4,'YY','teacher',43,114,'关于您的牛津大学申请状态更新','关于您的申请有重要更新，请查看详情。','application_update','important',1,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','2025-10-27 14:11:20','2025-10-27 14:12:43',_binary '\0','2025-10-27 14:12:43.000000',NULL),(50,4,'YY','teacher',43,114,'消息通知','你的面试要开始了，注意链接，请自己参加Thank you for contacting GRE® Services at Educational Testing Service. Each customer is important to us, and we will strive to respond to your inquiry as soon as possible within the next two business days.\n\nFor detailed information about GRE tests and services, visit our website at www.ets.org/gre. If you are writing about registering, rescheduling, canceling or